00:53:40.840 --> 00:53:45.249
Edward Wertz (Hashgraph): The remote endpoint sends it to the Clipper service.

380
00:53:45.610 --> 00:53:51.760
Edward Wertz (Hashgraph): It's handled, the Remote Clipper application is invoked, and then a response message is sent back.

